<title>UK: London gold ends firmer after OTC options expiry.</title>
<headline>London gold ends firmer after OTC options expiry.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closes firmer in London at $327.25/$327.75, up $3.45 from Friday's close, after OTC options expiry.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ends higher at $4.38/$4.40, up seven cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Finishes stronger at $429.50/$432.50, up $7.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Ends up $5.00 at $204.00/$207.00.</p>
</text>
